feat(scripts): probe prints top-5 words extended greedily to punctuation

Rework the probe output: instead of dumping raw tokens, show the top 5
candidates (with seed probability) and extend each along a single greedy
top-1 path — no branching — until a word ends the sentence, the model
dries up, or --max-words (default 30). Mirrors the plugin's idle
deepening (depth, not width). Drops --continue; adds --max-words.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
